            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Torrid 0.2.0</h2>
<p>New:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Notifications: Get a notification when a download finishes or fails.</li>
  <li>Dock icon: While downloading, the flame turns blue and burns back to orange from the bottom up as the overall progress.</li>
  <li>Finder: Files that are still downloading show a progress bar in Finder.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Torrid 0.2.0 (简体中文)</h2>
<p>新增：</p>
<ul>
  <li>通知：下载完成或失败时发系统通知。</li>
  <li>Dock 图标：下载时火焰变成蓝色，来代表进度。</li>
  <li>访达：还在下载的文件会在访达里显示进度条。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
